Links 2.30 for PsiWeb (web/links). Applied by web/links/fetch.sh.
- drivers.c, links.h, main.c: the "psi" graphics driver (GRDRV_PSI), always graphics mode
- img.c (PSI_LAZY_IMAGES): no decoder or full-size buffer kept for pictures not yet drawn
- jpeg.c (PSI_JPEG_SCALE): libjpeg scales while decoding; buffered mode only for progressive
- html.c (PSIWEB): no <link rel=canonical/alternate/...> lines, no prefetch/preload

